Offline access and verification
-------------------------------
Android assets legal/ contain this NOTICE and the referenced license texts,
provenance, and inventory. In the app: Me > Licenses. The reader uses packaged
assets, not a web page or server request, and is also available before pairing through the first-run Licenses button. The inventory records source URLs and hashes.
Run python3 licenses/check_legal.py, then after a build run it with --apk PATH
against the exact artifact to check packaged bytes. Source checks alone do not
prove APK packaging, UI rendering, or legal compliance.
